      "label": "Shadows of Twilight Past (Mindscape Cinema N°1)",
      "description": "Upon entering the battlefield, Pyrois gains 1,000 Decibels. This effect can trigger once every 180s in Investigation Zone mode. CRIT Rate increases by 8%.",
